{%- doc -%}
  Bespoke hub/routing page for the "Tous les accessoires" collection
  (handle: tous-les-accessoires) — the page a visitor lands on from the
  nav's "Accessoires" entry without picking a specific range first.

  Deliberately NOT a product grid, unlike its three sibling pages
  (collection-vigilia-touch-shop / -elite-shop / -key-shop). This
  collection mixes 52 products across three mutually INCOMPATIBLE alarm
  ecosystems (Vigilia/Touch AM30x, Élite PA501Z, Key SA501) — showing
  them together risks a customer adding an accessory that won't work
  with their actual system. So the job here is routing (pick your
  system, then land on the right shop page) plus general education
  (what do these accessory types even do), not browsing/buying — no
  add-to-cart, no quantity steppers, no JS filtering, no cart-drawer
  wiring. Static page, on purpose.

  Signature: the three system cards read as "device profiles" rather
  than plain nav tiles — model code set large in the same IBM Plex Mono
  used for the shop pages' digital-readout counts, a steady green LED
  (not a filter toggle here, just "this system is available"), and one
  verified differentiator per system pulled from real product copy
  (Élite's Zigbee compatibility, Touch's 4.3" touchscreen, Key's
  "sans abonnement" line lifted from the Starter Pack Key's own product
  description) — deliberately not invented claims.

  The accessory-type glossary below reuses the exact same 6 category
  icons already drawn for the three shop pages, for full visual
  continuity across the family of pages rather than a fresh icon set.

  Prefixed `hub-` (distinct from the shop pages' `das-`/`vts-`) since
  this is a different kind of page, not another shop.
{%- enddoc -%}

<div id="shopify-section-{{ section.id }}" class="hub">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .hub{
      --hub-navy:#0c1e4a;
      --hub-navy-deep:#071228;
      --hub-ink:#171b23;
      --hub-gray:#5b6270;
      --hub-paper:#f5f6fa;
      --hub-line:#dde3ec;
      --hub-green:#037e05;
      --hub-green-glow:#22c55e;
      --hub-mono:'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
      color:var(--hub-ink);
      background:#fff;
    }
    .hub *{box-sizing:border-box;}
    .hub .hub-wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
    .hub svg{display:block;}

    /* ---- hero ---- */
    .hub-hero{padding:64px 0 48px;text-align:center;}
    .hub-eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--hub-green);margin-bottom:16px;
    }
    .hub-eyebrow::before{content:"";width:14px;height:2px;background:var(--hub-green);}
    .hub-hero h1{
      font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1;margin:0 auto;
      font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);max-width:640px;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);
    }
    .hub-hero__sub{
      font-size:clamp(15px,1.8vw,17px);color:var(--hub-gray);
      max-width:560px;margin:18px auto 0;line-height:1.6;
    }

    /* ---- system selector (signature) ---- */
    .hub-systems{padding:8px 0 72px;}
    .hub-systems__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;}
    @media (min-width:820px){.hub-systems__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;}}

    .hub-system{
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;
      border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:20px;padding:30px 26px;background:#fff;
      transition:box-shadow .25s ease,transform .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;
    }
    .hub-system:hover{
      box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(7,18,40,.28);transform:translateY(-4px);
      border-color:var(--hub-navy);
    }
    .hub-system__status{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--hub-mono);
      font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hub-gray);
    }
    .hub-system__dot{
      width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--hub-green-glow);flex-shrink:0;
      box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,.18);
    }
    .hub-system__code{
      font-family:var(--hub-mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--hub-green);
    }
    .hub-system__name{font-size:25px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);line-height:1.2;}
    .hub-system__desc{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--hub-gray);flex:1;}
    .hub-system__chip{
      align-self:flex-start;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-navy);
      background:var(--hub-paper);border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;
    }
    .hub-system__cta{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:4px;
      font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-navy);
    }
    .hub-system__cta svg{transition:transform .2s ease;}
    .hub-system:hover .hub-system__cta svg{transform:translateX(3px);}

    /* ---- glossary ---- */
    .hub-glossary{padding:56px 0 72px;background:var(--hub-paper);}
    .hub-glossary__head{text-align:center;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
    .hub-glossary__head h2{
      font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,28px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);margin:0 0 10px;
    }
    .hub-glossary__head p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--hub-gray);line-height:1.6;margin:0;}

    .hub-glossary__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.hub-glossary__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;}}
    @media (min-width:1020px){.hub-glossary__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}

    .hub-term{
      display:flex;gap:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 22px;
    }
    .hub-term__icon{
      flex-shrink:0;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--hub-paper);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--hub-navy);
    }
    .hub-term__name{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--hub-ink);margin:0 0 4px;}
    .hub-term__desc{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--hub-gray);margin:0;}

    .hub-note{
      display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;max-width:820px;margin:32px auto 0;
      padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #f79009;border-radius:10px;
    }
    .hub-note svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;color:#9a6a00;}
    .hub-note p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--hub-ink);}

    .hub-system:focus-visible,.hub-system__cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--hub-navy);outline-offset:3px;}

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .hub-system{transition:none;}
      .hub-system__cta svg{transition:none;}
    }
  </style>

  {%- comment -%} Hero {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="hub-hero">
    <div class="hub-wrap">
      <span class="hub-eyebrow">Daewoo Security</span>
      <h1>Trouvez les accessoires faits pour votre système</h1>
      <p class="hub-hero__sub">
        Daewoo Security propose trois gammes d'alarme, chacune avec ses propres accessoires
        compatibles. Choisissez votre système pour accéder directement aux bons produits.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} System selector {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="hub-systems">
    <div class="hub-wrap">
      <div class="hub-systems__grid">
        <a href="/collections/compatible-gamme-vigilia-touch" class="hub-system">
          <span class="hub-system__status"><span class="hub-system__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Système disponible</span>
          <span class="hub-system__code">AM30x</span>
          <span class="hub-system__name">Vigilia / Touch</span>
          <p class="hub-system__desc">Centrale avec écran tactile 4,3" et large gamme d'accessoires sans fil, du détecteur à la sirène.</p>
          <span class="hub-system__chip">Écran tactile</span>
          <span class="hub-system__cta">
            Voir les accessoires
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a href="/collections/gamme-elite-accessoires" class="hub-system">
          <span class="hub-system__status"><span class="hub-system__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Système disponible</span>
          <span class="hub-system__code">PA501Z</span>
          <span class="hub-system__name">Élite</span>
          <p class="hub-system__desc">Système compatible Zigbee, pour une sécurité connectée et évolutive au fil de vos besoins.</p>
          <span class="hub-system__chip">Zigbee</span>
          <span class="hub-system__cta">
            Voir les accessoires
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a href="/collections/accessoires" class="hub-system">
          <span class="hub-system__status"><span class="hub-system__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Système disponible</span>
          <span class="hub-system__code">SA501</span>
          <span class="hub-system__name">Key</span>
          <p class="hub-system__desc">Alarme sans fil simple et fiable, sans abonnement, pour une protection efficace au quotidien.</p>
          <span class="hub-system__chip">Sans abonnement</span>
          <span class="hub-system__cta">
            Voir les accessoires
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Glossary {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="hub-glossary">
    <div class="hub-wrap">
      <div class="hub-glossary__head">
        <h2>Comprendre les types d'accessoires</h2>
        <p>Chaque système d'alarme Daewoo Security se complète avec les mêmes grandes familles d'accessoires. Voici à quoi elles servent.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hub-glossary__grid">
        <div class="hub-term">
          <span class="hub-term__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><path d="M8 8a5.66 5.66 0 0 1 8 0"></path><path d="M5 5a10 10 0 0 1 14 0"></path></svg></span>
          <div>
            <p class="hub-term__name">Détecteurs</p>
            <p class="hub-term__desc">Mouvement, vibration, fumée ou fuite d'eau : ils surveillent en continu et déclenchent l'alarme au moindre signe anormal.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-term">
          <span class="hub-term__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="3" width="10" height="18" rx="1"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle><path d="M15 3l4 2v16l-4-2"></path></svg></span>
          <div>
            <p class="hub-term__name">Contacteurs</p>
            <p class="hub-term__desc">Posés sur une porte, une fenêtre ou un garage, ils détectent la moindre ouverture non autorisée.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-term">
          <span class="hub-term__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"></path><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"></path></svg></span>
          <div>
            <p class="hub-term__name">Sirènes</p>
            <p class="hub-term__desc">Intérieures ou extérieures, elles dissuadent l'intrus et alertent le voisinage en cas d'intrusion.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-term">
          <span class="hub-term__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7" cy="15" r="3.2"></circle><path d="M9.3 12.7L18 4"></path><path d="M14.5 8.2l2.3 2.3"></path><path d="M17.2 5.5l2.3 2.3"></path></svg></span>
          <div>
            <p class="hub-term__name">Contrôle d'accès</p>
            <p class="hub-term__desc">Télécommandes, badges et claviers permettent d'armer ou désarmer votre système en toute simplicité.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-term">
          <span class="hub-term__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"></path></svg></span>
          <div>
            <p class="hub-term__name">Centrale</p>
            <p class="hub-term__desc">Le cœur du système : elle reçoit les alertes de tous vos accessoires et les transmet en cas de besoin. Un amplificateur peut étendre sa portée radio dans les grandes maisons.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-term">
          <span class="hub-term__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3h6l4 4v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z"></path><rect x="9.5" y="9" width="5" height="4" rx="1"></rect></svg></span>
          <div>
            <p class="hub-term__name">Cartes SIM</p>
            <p class="hub-term__desc">Pour une connexion indépendante de votre box internet, en cas de coupure ou d'absence de Wifi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-note">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 16v-5"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>
        <p><strong>Bon à savoir.</strong> Les accessoires ne sont pas interchangeables d'un système à l'autre : un accessoire Vigilia/Touch ne fonctionne pas avec une centrale Élite ou Key. Utilisez les trois cartes ci-dessus pour retrouver les accessoires compatibles avec votre système.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Accessories hub",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
